          {
            "type": "callout",
            "tone": "correction",
            "title": "Book correction",
            "text": "In Table 11.3 the IUPAC name of the tert-butyl group (CH₃)₃C– is printed ‘1,1-Dimethylpropyl’; it is 1,1-dimethylethyl: the longest chain from the attached carbon has only two carbons (1,1-dimethylpropyl is (CH₃)₂C(–)CH₂CH₃, a five-carbon group)."
